  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nPsalm 2 is a first-person indie horror walking simulator.<p></p>\n<p>Your elevator begins moving down. You don’t know how many floors separate you from the bottom or what inhabits these dark shafts. You must come to realize: the descent will not continue until you see what is hidden.</p>\n<p>You move sequentially from floor to floor — each of which is a separate fragment of distorted reality. You don’t know who or what lives here. You don’t know if it’s hiding around the corner, blending into the environment, or has no form at all. But the rule is always the same: the elevator won’t go further until you find what is hidden.</p>\n<p>Beautiful graphics and high-quality volumetric 3D sound will help you fully experience the game’s atmosphere.</p>\n<p>The game contains flashing lights that may trigger epileptic seizures.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Approximate playtime: 1 hour\n</li><li>Horror game\n</li><li>Walking simulator\n</li><li>First-person view\n</li><li>High-quality sound\n</li><li>Realistic graphics\n</li></ul>\n",
